  "releaseNotes": "1.3.2: Independent mutable graphs by default; MapFrom selects a source value for recursive mapping, while explicit final converters retain ownership. CurrentCulture scalar text conversion; existing-target mapping, member rules, projection/context and generator improvements. Upgrade both packages and recompile generated consumers. Behavioral migration required; Mapster performance parity, current NativeAOT execution and real SQL translation are not claimed. See CHANGELOG.md.",
